Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.15,0:00:05.11,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}20{\fs68}号 里昂站首轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.11,0:00:07.62,TL,,0,0,0,,法国人穆泰对阵同胞安贝尔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.62,0:00:10.47,TL,,0,0,0,,打到决胜盘 穆泰{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.15,0:00:15.01,TL,,0,0,0,,打完这一分 他突然倒在了地上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.71,0:00:19.26,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, well, is he cramping?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N哦 他是抽筋了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.41,0:00:21.16,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I think that might be the situation.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N看来是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:27.91,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, he has been away from action like we said for nearly two months.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他已经快两个月没比赛了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.05,0:00:30.36,TL,,0,0,0,,他被扶了起来 比赛接着打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.36,0:00:33.28,TL,,0,0,0,,可主裁还是判他超时 给了一次警告
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.28,0:00:36.21,TL,,0,0,0,,按规则 抽筋不能叫医疗暂停
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.65,0:00:39.22,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘打进抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.22,0:00:40.97,TL,,0,0,0,,他先{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.65,0:00:46.57,TL,,0,0,0,,接下来九分 他拿了七分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.57,0:00:48.33,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}赢下抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.33,0:00:51.45,TL,,0,0,0,,可抽筋倒地 为什么还会被警告？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.41,0:00:56.61,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, it's glorious.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N太漂亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.91,0:01:11.81,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a fighter he is.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N真是个斗士
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.05,0:01:13.43,TL,,0,0,0,,先看规则
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.43,0:01:15.64,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}ATP{\fs68}和大满贯的规则都写着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.64,0:01:18.17,TL,,0,0,0,,抽筋 不能叫医疗暂停
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.56,0:01:20.45,TL,,0,0,0,,只能在换边的{\fs78}90{\fs68}秒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.45,0:01:23.22,TL,,0,0,0,,或者盘间的{\fs78}120{\fs68}秒里治疗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.57,0:01:26.55,TL,,0,0,0,,一场比赛 抽筋最多治疗两次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.98,0:01:29.77,TL,,0,0,0,,分与分之间 只有{\fs78}25{\fs68}秒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.13,0:01:32.33,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次超时 是警告 再犯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.33,0:01:33.89,TL,,0,0,0,,发球方判一次发球失误
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.89,0:01:35.94,TL,,0,0,0,,接发方直接丢一分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.40,0:01:37.21,TL,,0,0,0,,真撑不住
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.21,0:01:39.44,TL,,0,0,0,,可以先放弃几分 甚至几局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.44,0:01:41.30,TL,,0,0,0,,拖到换边再治
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.45,0:01:44.10,TL,,0,0,0,,这条规则 不少球员都碰上过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:45.38,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2021{\fs68}年迈阿密
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.38,0:01:47.79,TL,,0,0,0,,梅德韦杰夫第三盘抽筋 一瘸一拐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.79,0:01:51.56,TL,,0,0,0,,最后{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}赢下波皮林
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.41,0:02:04.51,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}You have to say, well played, Daniil Medvedev, digging so deep.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N打得好 梅德韦杰夫咬牙撑住了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.61,0:02:14.11,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Clearly, really struggling with cramp, but he has somehow found a way to win that match.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N被抽筋折磨 他还是赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.35,0:02:16.12,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2022{\fs68}年阿卡普尔科
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.12,0:02:18.34,TL,,0,0,0,,科兹洛夫对季米特洛夫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.34,0:02:21.07,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘 他打着打着就抽筋了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.71,0:02:25.06,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He gets the break!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他破发了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.16,0:02:27.06,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And he's cramping!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N可他抽筋了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.06,0:02:33.01,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh my goodness. Unbelievable.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N天哪 难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.21,0:02:38.41,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}No, I think he has to forfeit this game to get to the change of ends.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他得放弃这一局 才能拖到换边
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.41,0:02:41.61,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I mean, Dimitrov helping him out here.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N季米特洛夫在帮他
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.01,0:02:44.91,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, isn't that great sportsmanship from Dimitrov?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N季米特洛夫真有体育精神
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.96,0:02:48.81,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He came straight over, he showed concern immediately.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他马上就过来 第一时间表示关心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.95,0:02:50.42,TL,,0,0,0,,最后科兹洛夫赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.42,0:02:52.75,TL,,0,0,0,,打了{\fs78}3{\fs68}小时{\fs78}21{\fs68}分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.75,0:02:58.29,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年上海 天气又湿又热
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.29,0:02:59.88,TL,,0,0,0,,辛纳右腿抽筋
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.88,0:03:02.33,TL,,0,0,0,,第三盘{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}落后 他选择退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.33,0:03:04.37,TL,,0,0,0,,和格里克斯普尔握手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.75,0:03:09.13,TL,,0,0,0,,今年澳网半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.13,0:03:11.09,TL,,0,0,0,,阿尔卡拉斯对兹维列夫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.09,0:03:13.68,TL,,0,0,0,,第三盘 阿尔卡拉斯的腿出了问题
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.68,0:03:15.70,TL,,0,0,0,,拿到一次医疗暂停
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.45,0:03:19.84,TL,,0,0,0,,医疗暂停之后 他接着打
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.84,0:03:21.16,TL,,0,0,0,,兹维列夫很不满
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.16,0:03:23.62,TL,,0,0,0,,认为抽筋不该给医疗暂停
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.65,0:03:29.11,TL,,0,0,0,,阿尔卡拉斯说 他以为是受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.11,0:03:30.51,TL,,0,0,0,,最后他{\fs78}5{\fs68}盘获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.51,0:03:32.82,TL,,0,0,0,,打了{\fs78}5{\fs68}小时{\fs78}27{\fs68}分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.75,0:03:36.41,TL,,0,0,0,,规则写得很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.41,0:03:39.19,TL,,0,0,0,,可抽筋到倒地 该不该多给几秒？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.19,0:03:40.78,TL,,0,0,0,,评论区说说
